 <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Ashish Yadav — Official Page</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1120;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 540px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #38bdf8;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 28px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #1e293b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .info-item {
      margin: 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <span class="badge">Live on GitHub Pages</span>
    <h1>Ashish Yadav</h1>
    <p>Namaste! Yeh meri live web page hai, jise maine GitHub Pages ke zariye publish kiya hai.</p>

    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="info-item"><strong>Location:</strong> Ashoknagar, Madhya Pradesh</div>
      <div class="info-item"><strong>Focus:</strong> Practical AI Tools, Python Basics &amp; Projects</div>
      <div class="info-item"><strong>Status:</strong> Website Live</div>
    </div>

    <a class="btn" href="#top">Welcome</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
